{"compact": {"ja_sv": "Utskottets förslag: att avslå motionsyrkandena (nuvarande ordning behålls).", "nej_sv": "Stöd för motförslaget: reservation 6 från V, C.", "avstar_sv": "Partiet markerar en egen linje som inte finns med i slutomröstningens två alternativ.", "ja_en": "The committee proposal: rejecting the motions (keeping things as they are).", "nej_en": "Backing the counter-proposal: reservation 6 by V, C.", "avstar_en": "The party marks a position of its own that is not one of the two final alternatives."}, "en": {"rubrik": "Business support", "dok_titel": "Economic policy", "forslag_text": "The Riksdag rejects the motions\n\n2023/24:332 by Helena Gellerman (L),\n\n2023/24:420 by Tobias Andersson et al. (SD) request 3,\n\n2023/24:893 by Elin Söderberg et al. (MP) requests 3 and 6,\n\n2023/24:1519 by Elin Söderberg et al. (MP) requests 26 and 30,\n\n2023/24:2281 by Josefin Malmqvist et al. (M) request 6,\n\n2023/24:2492 by Elisabeth Thand Ringqvist et al. (C) requests 29 and 30,\n\n2023/24:2499 by Helena Vilhelmsson et al. (C) requests 38 and 39 as well as\n\n2023/24:2631 by Fredrik Olovsson et al. (S) requests 1-3, 6 and 7.", "notis": "The Riksdag rejected approximately 100 proposals in motions about economic policy from the 2023 general motion period.\nThe motions deal among other things with business promotion, competition issues and specific industries and sectors.\nThe Riksdag refers among other things to ongoing work.", "alternatives": ["The Riksdag rejects the motions\n\n2023/24:332 by Helena Gellerman (L),\n\n2023/24:420 by Tobias Andersson et al. (SD) request 3,\n\n2023/24:893 by Elin Söderberg et al. (MP) requests 3 and 6,\n\n2023/24:1519 by Elin Söderberg et al. (MP) requests 26 and 30,\n\n2023/24:2281 by Josefin Malmqvist et al. (M) request 6,\n\n2023/24:2492 by Elisabeth Thand Ringqvist et al. (C) requests 29 and 30,\n\n2023/24:2499 by Helena Vilhelmsson et al. (C) requests 38 and 39 as well as\n\n2023/24:2631 by Fredrik Olovsson et al. (S) reques